<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Plataforma anônima para compartilhar segredos, apoio e desabafos." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
  <title><%= title %> | meusegredo.shop</title>
  <% if (typeof csrfToken !== 'undefined') { %>
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
  <% } %>
</head>
<body class="theme-dark">
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/">MEUSEGREDO.SHOP</a>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="/contar" class="button button-red">Contar Segredo</a>
        <a href="/ranking">Ranking</a>
        <a href="/sobre">Sobre</a>
        <button id="theme-toggle" class="button button-ghost">Tema</button>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <section class="hero-card">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Todo mundo guarda um segredo</span>
        <h1>Alguns merecem ser contados.</h1>
        <p>Compartilhe anonimamente, leia histórias reais e encontre apoio em uma comunidade segura e acolhedora.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contar" class="button button-red">Contar Segredo</a>
        <a href="/ranking" class="button button-outline">Ver Ranking</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <% if (success) { %>
      <div class="notification-bar" id="notification-bar"><%= success %></div>
    <% } else { %>
      <div class="notification-bar" id="notification-bar"></div>
    <% } %>
